{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MgNUf5qFFJYGPxBbg3r5oC","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Brief: Fix setup.sh for all OSes\n2\t\n3\ttype: feature\n4\tid: plus\n5\tbranch: feature/plus_fix-setup-sh-for-all-oses\n6\tdate: 2026-10-14\n7\tauthor: Leander Muskalla\n8\t\n9\t## What\n10\t\n11\tA user trying to selfhost solyto on Arch has reported that the setup.sh script dies on trying to change ownership of storage/ to www-data. That makes sense since Arch has no www-data user. We were able to fix the issue by changing that one line in the setup.sh script from chown -R www-data:www-data to chown -R 33:33.\n12\tHowever, I think we might need a better solution overall that works with all OSes.\n13\t\n14\t## Why\n15\t\n16\t<!-- Why does this need to exist? What problem does it solve for the user? -->\n17\t\n18\t## Out of scope\n19\t\n20\t<!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->\n21\t\n22\t## Notes\n23\t\n24\t<!-- Anything the analyst or developer should know before starting. -->\n25\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"289b63f4-906f-4043-9ead-bdf937df25bd","uuid":"ac4176c3-d5ca-449e-b4a9-b11439a8aaab","timestamp":"2026-10-14T12:33:42.506Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/docs/jobs/plus_fix-setup-sh-for-all-oses/brief.md","content":"# Brief: Fix setup.sh for all OSes\n\ntype: feature\nid: plus\nbranch: feature/plus_fix-setup-sh-for-all-oses\ndate: 2026-10-14\nauthor: Leander Muskalla\n\n## What\n\nA user trying to selfhost solyto on Arch has reported that the setup.sh script dies on trying to change ownership of storage/ to www-data. That makes sense since Arch has no www-data user. We were able to fix the issue by changing that one line in the setup.sh script from chown -R www-data:www-data to chown -R 33:33.\nHowever, I think we might need a better solution overall that works with all OSes.\n\n## Why\n\n<!-- Why does this need to exist? What problem does it solve for the user? -->\n\n## Out of scope\n\n<!-- What are we explicitly NOT doing in this job? -->\n\n## Notes\n\n<!-- Anything the analyst or developer should know before starting. -->\n","numLines":25,"startLine":1,"totalLines":25}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01MgNUf5qFFJYGPxBbg3r5oC","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
